{{ query }}

SOURCES RETRIEVED SO FAR:
{% for s in sources %}
--- [{{ s.id or loop.index }}] {{ s.title }} ({{ s.domain }}, {{ s.tier }}{% if s.published %}, {{ s.published }}{% endif %})
